und-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Time difference of 6.194284 secs<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; print(&quot;method 2&quot;)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">[1] &quot;method 2&quot;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; print(method2.end - method2.start)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Time difference of 1.347049 secs<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; # end</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-EuM0gogCb_E/WSQ39FhqyII/AAAAAAAALjs/vF0CvEy8Mas7Kj5-PAjgXT9wo8iS8p8RgCLcB/s1600/data.frame_operation.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-EuM0gogCb_E/WSQ39FhqyII/AAAAAAAALjs/vF0CvEy8Mas7Kj5-PAjgXT9wo8iS8p8RgCLcB/s1600/data.frame_operation.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237673732000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nwucnmg8waa6zDib6QRbV\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-EuM0gogCb_E/WSQ39FhqyII/AAAAAAAALjs/vF0CvEy8Mas7Kj5-PAjgXT9wo8iS8p8RgCLcB/s400/data.frame_operation.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"298\" height=\"400\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div># title: data.frame operation</div><div># date: 2017.5.23</div><div>set.seed(168)</div><div>samplesize &lt;- 10</div><div>data &lt;- data.frame(date=seq(as.Date(&quot;2017/5/1&quot;), by=&quot;day&quot;, length.out=samplesize),</div><div>                   f1=sample(2,10, replace=TRUE)-1, </div><div>                   f2=sample(2,10,replace=TRUE), </div><div>                   abc=1:10, </div><div>                   def=11:20)</div><div>head(data)</div><div><br></div><div>method1.start &lt;- Sys.time()</div><div># 方法1 採用指標-FOR</div><div>NUM &lt;- nrow(data)</div><div>index1 &lt;- c()</div><div>index2 &lt;- c()</div></font></div></code></div></div></div>"
