     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Paul,<div><br></div><div>考量 for 與 apply 不同方式, apply 應該是比較快, 將 samplesize 改為100000, 結果差異更明顯.</div><div><br></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; print(paste(&quot;sample size=&quot;,\r\nsamplesize))</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">[1] &quot;sample size= 1e+05&quot;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; print(&quot;method 1&quot;)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">[1] &quot;method 1&quot;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; print(method1.end - method1.start)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Time difference of 6.194284 secs</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; print(&quot;method 2&quot;)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">[1] &quot;method 2&quot;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; print(method2.end - method2.start)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Time difference of 1.347049 secs</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; # end</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-EuM0gogCb_E/WSQ39FhqyII/AAAAAAAALjs/vF0CvEy8Mas7Kj5-PAjgXT9wo8iS8p8RgCLcB/s1600/data.frame_operation.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-EuM0gogCb_E/WSQ39FhqyII/AAAAAAAALjs/vF0CvEy8Mas7Kj5-PAjgXT9wo8iS8p8RgCLcB/s1600/data.frame_operation.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237673738000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3yW8_jxlgb6Wld-qWVs7BX\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-EuM0gogCb_E/WSQ39FhqyII/AAAAAAAALjs/vF0CvEy8Mas7Kj5-PAjgXT9wo8iS8p8RgCLcB/s400/data.frame_operation.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"298\" height=\"400\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div># title: data.frame operation</div><div># date: 2017.5.23</div><div>set.seed(168)</div><div>samplesize &lt;- 10</div><div>data &lt;- data.frame(date=seq(as.Date(&quot;2017/5/1&quot;), by=&quot;day&quot;, length.out=samplesize),</div><div>                   f1=sample(2,10, replace=TRUE)-1, </div><div>                   f2=sample(2,10,replace=TRUE), </div><div>                   abc=1:10, </div><div>                   def=11:20)</div><div>head(data)</div><div><br></div><div>method1.start &lt;- Sys.time()</div><div># 方法1 採用指標-FOR</div><div>NUM &lt;- nrow(data)</div><div>index1 &lt;- c()</div><div>index2 &lt;- c()</div><div>for (i in 1:NUM) {</div><div>  if ((data[i,&quot;f1&quot;] == 1) &amp;&amp; (data[i,&quot;f2&quot;] == 2)) {</div><div>    index1 &lt;- c(index1,i)</div><div>  } else if ((data[i,&quot;f1&quot;] == 0) &amp;&amp; (data[i,&quot;f2&quot;] == 2)) {</div><div>    index2 &lt;- c(index2,i)</div><div>  }</div><div>}</div><div><br></div><div>data[index1,]</div><div>data[index2,]</div><div>method1.end &lt;- Sys.time()</div><div><br></div><div># 方法2 採用指標-apply</div><div>method2.start &lt;- Sys.time()</div><div>index3 &lt;- c()</div><div>indexvalue &lt;- apply(data[,c(&quot;f1&quot;, &quot;f2&quot;)], 1, function(x) {</div><div>  if (x[1] == &quot;1&quot; &amp; x[2] == &quot;2&quot;) {</div><div>    index3 &lt;- c(index3, TRUE)</div><div>  } else {</div><div>    index3 &lt;- c(index3, FALSE)</div><div>  }</div><div>  return(index3)</div><div>})</div><div>data[indexvalue,] # same as 方法1</div><div># 同理可建立 f1=0, f2=2的查詢結果</div><div>method2.end &lt;- Sys.time()</div><div>print(paste(&quot;sample size=&quot;, samplesize))</div><div>print(&quot;method 1&quot;)</div><div>print(method1.end - method1.start)</div><div>print(&quot;method 2&quot;)</div><div>print(method2.end - method2.start)</div><div># end</div></font></div></code></div><br><br><br>Paul Ho於 2017年5月16日星期二 UTC+8下午9時56分05秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">我想問在R 內的 IF速度很慢的問題.<div>我想在我的data.frame 找出一個column 是否等1 and 同一個rows 內的column 是否等於2....</div><div>我的code 如下:</div><div><div>NUM=nrow(data)</div><div>for (i in 1:NUM) {</div></div><div>if ((data[i,&quot;f1] == 1) &amp;&amp; (data[i,&quot;f2&quot;]==2)) {</div><div><div>                CASE=data.frame(data[i,&#39;date&#39;],data[i,&#39;abc&#39;])</div><div>        } else if ((data[i,&quot;f1] == 0) &amp;&amp; (data[i,&quot;f2&quot;]==2)) {</div></div><div><div>                CASE=data.frame(data[i,&#39;date&#39;],data[i,&#39;def&#39;])</div></div><div>}</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
}
